<section card-margin-hidden="true" background-overlay-intensity="0.5" background-overlay="tint" vertical-align="end" id="bbs022" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>Full-bleed photograph with a short statement and one supporting line over a tinted scrim, pinned to the lower left; the scrim's intensity is what keeps the type legible on a busy image.</card-template-instructions><ai-image prompt="Image in this deck's authored imagery style" background="true" meta='{"width":2560,"height":1440}' /><grid spacing="none"><grid-item vertical-align="end" id="y9f2PFamF3"><h1 style="padding-right: 36%" font-size="44pt">Capacity is the constraint we can remove</h1><p style="padding-right: 40%" font-size="lg">Every other number in this plan depends on the warehouse keeping pace with orders.</p></grid-item></grid></section>